WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.673
Sid took Sam back to Rex.

2
00:00:16.674 --> 00:00:25.992
"I can't babysit Sam," Sid said.

3
00:00:25.993 --> 00:00:29.335
Sam hit a log with a big stick.

4
00:00:29.336 --> 00:00:34.467
Whap, whap, whap!

5
00:00:34.468 --> 00:00:40.620
Tor walked over.

6
00:00:40.621 --> 00:00:43.923
"What's going on?" she asked.

7
00:00:43.924 --> 00:00:46.270
Rex pointed to Sam.

8
00:00:46.271 --> 00:00:49.993
"We're babysitting him.

9
00:00:49.994 --> 00:00:53.413
His name is Sam."

10
00:00:53.414 --> 00:00:56.267
"Hi, Sam," Tor said.

11
00:00:56.268 --> 00:01:00.181
"Are you having fun?"

12
00:01:00.182 --> 00:01:03.582
"No!" Sam said.

13
00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:07.664
"I can find something fun," Tor said.

14
00:01:07.665 --> 00:01:10.726
She dug in her bag.

15
00:01:10.727 --> 00:01:16.142
"Oh, this is fun!" Tor said.

16
00:01:16.143 --> 00:01:18.887
She held up a puppet.

17
00:01:18.888 --> 00:01:22.080
Sam jumped back.

18
00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:24.501
"I don't like that!"

19
00:01:24.502 --> 00:01:29.657
Tor frowned. "Hmph!"

20
00:01:29.658 --> 00:01:35.122
Sara came back.

21
00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:43.017
Everyone looked mad.

22
00:01:43.018 --> 00:01:52.214
Sam was stomping and crying.

23
00:01:52.215 --> 00:01:56.478
"We can't babysit Sam!" Rex said.

24
00:01:56.479 --> 00:02:01.330
"I want my mommy!" Sam cried.

25
00:02:01.331 --> 00:02:11.265
Sara sighed. "Come with me, Sam.

26
00:02:11.266 --> 00:02:17.551
I'm still looking for your mom."

